{"article": {"content": {"content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fcd78ade-13fb9285-0f64-4fee-8126-21d91e3fd6ea&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fcd78ade-13fb9285-0f64-4fee-8126-21d91e3fd6ea\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Hello Daevas,</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">The starting line up for the global commercial launch servers are available!</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">In AION 2, each server houses only one faction. Every Elyos server is paired with an Asmodian counterpart, giving both factions their own home while still meeting in shared PvP spaces like the Abyss. When you launch Aion 2, you\u2019ll first choose your Region, then your Faction, and finally select from the available servers in that region.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h2 id=\"\"><strong>What is Server Matchmaking?</strong></h2><div data-contents-type=\"text\">In Aion 2, the Elyos and Asmodians each live on their own servers. But the war between the factions doesn't stay behind borders for long. As you journey through Atreia, you'll get chances to face the opposing faction in modes such as <strong>Spacetime Rifts</strong> and <strong>the Abyss</strong>.&nbsp;To bring the two sides together, each Elyos server is paired with an Asmodian server for a limited time. Whenever you enter the Abyss or another cross-faction mode, the players you meet from the other faction will come from your matched server.&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">For example, if the Asmodian server <strong>Israphel</strong> is paired with the Elyos server <strong>Siel</strong>, every Israphel Asmodian who enters the Abyss will run into Siel's Elyos. Those are the players you'll be clashing with, competing against, and\u2026 holding grudges against.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h2 id=\"\"><u><strong>Server and Matchmaking List</strong></u></h2><div data-contents-type=\"text\">*Please refer to this notice for the most recent server list as it will be continuously updated.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h3 id=\"\"><strong>Europe</strong></h3><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"_2CAsiFd9UHbUOqzd0e7ioe _1CtoyG6UPAlYp7PCGLXx8L\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 193px;\"><col style=\"width: 55px;\"><col style=\"width: 198px;\"><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\" data-colwidth=\"193,55,198\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Launch Servers</div></th><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">\u200b</div></th></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"193\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Elyos</div></th><th data-colwidth=\"55\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">vs.</div></th><th data-colwidth=\"198\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Asmodian</div></th><th style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Time Updated</div></th></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"193\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Nania</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"55\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-